bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_NightsongAlone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_EPI_Letter_NightsongAlone\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d5ea9fd4-6538-46d6-8aa4-3688466e8bfe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d5ea9fd4-6538-46d6-8aa4-3688466e8bfe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d5ea9fd4-6538-46d6-8aa4-3688466e8bfe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Within the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/40px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp/20px-Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Jeweled_Chest_A_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_of_Grateful_Words\" title=\"Chest of Grateful Words\">Chest of Grateful Words</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Ally mine,\n</p><p><br>\nIt has been a full half-year since last we spoke. Your great victory against the wicked brain of brains still plays before my eyes by nights; ho, it was a sight I'll cherish for the remainder of my infinite days. I hope these last turns of my <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">mother's</a> face in the sky have brought you rest and peace.\n</p><p><br>\nBut rest has not found Dame Aylin, no - I pursue the heels of a villain no less foul than the so-called '<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a>'. An assailant who has targeted <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûnite</a> enclaves across the coast. But fear not! Dame Aylin will find them. And you have seen yourself what she does to those deserving of her boot.\n</p><p><br>\nThe road is long. It is lonely. And I have not forgotten all I've lost. But I cherish what I have found, too.\n</p><p><br>\nYours eternally,\n</p><p>Dame Aylin\nDaughter of the Moonmaiden Selûne\nThe Nightsong-no-more\nAnon and Everlasting\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Contingent on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Isobel\" title=\"Isobel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Isobel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Isobel\" title=\"Isobel\">Isobel</a> being dead and Aylin surviving <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.</li>\n<li>This letter is currently (Patch #8, Hotfix #34) not obtainable, because for it to be sent, it is checked if the flag <code>SCE_Isobel_State_WillJoinCamp_bd91b63d-9c38-1399-cb7d-9eeddff8b039</code> is set true, but it is never set.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213752\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.081 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.085 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2251/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38526/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11562/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1603/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.033/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1275477/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   70.738      1 -total\n 62.70%   44.354      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 37.24%   26.344      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 36.63%   25.909      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 35.63%   25.205      1 Template:Ambox\n 33.40%   23.624      8 Template:Icon_text\n 30.52%   21.587     25 Template:Trim\n 13.59%    9.611      2 Template:Uid\n  9.66%    6.830      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n  8.34%    5.901      3 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47364-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714213752 and revision id 345812. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->